# Host header. The init-job reaches the server by internal service name (which
# resolves on the Docker network) but sends ZITADEL_HOST_HEADER (the instance's
# external domain[:port]) as the Host header so the request matches the instance.
#
# Required environment variables:
#   ZITADEL_INSTANCE_URL  - Internal base URL of the Zitadel server
#                           (e.g. http://app-zitadel:8080)
#   ZITADEL_HOST_HEADER   - Instance external domain[:port] sent as the Host header
#                           (e.g. "10.0.0.1:8085" or "id.example.com")
#   ZITADEL_PAT_FILE      - Path to the FIRSTINSTANCE machine-user PAT file
#
# Optional environment variable:
#   ZITADEL_PROVISIONING_PATH - Path to provisioning artifact (default: /provisioning/zitadel-provisioning.json)
#
# Exit codes:
#   0 - Provisioning applied successfully.
#   1 - Missing PAT/env, invalid artifact, unsupported type, or API error.

